| `scripts/jobs/link_corpus.py` | Adds keyword and entity link edges to `wiki/corpus.json` in place; `scripts/jobs/check_corpus.py` imports it to rebuild the same links. | `make site-data` | — | Adds edges only; the nodes are `scripts/jobs/build_corpus.py`'s. Escaping writes exit 2; mutations use the confined resolved path. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
